# Diagnostic route (no game data): FormManagerBase.DoTerminationDialog with
# both buttons (FormManagerBase.cs:702-711). Escape on the title (only main
# windows, no back soft label): the first dialog is answered No (game
# continues), the second Yes (Exit event, termination; the run ends there).
anchor timeout=2400
wait frames=104
keydown ESCAPE
wait frames=2
keyup ESCAPE
wait frames=40
keydown ESCAPE
wait frames=2
keyup ESCAPE
wait frames=60
end
